sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Alice
  actor B as Bob
  participant C
  A->>B: Hello Bob
  B-->>A: Hi Alice
  A-)C: async
  C-xA: lost
  A->B: plain
  B-->A: dotted plain
  A->>+B: activate
  B-->>-A: deactivate
  Note over A,B: ignored
  loop Every minute
    A->>B: ping
  end
  D->>A: new participant
